1
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,800
(Let it go.)

2
00:00:43,724 --> 00:00:45,964
=Revenge From A Wife=

3
00:00:46,091 --> 00:00:48,317
=Episode 22=

4
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,000
She isn't Su Cao at all.

5
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:52,280
She is

6
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:54,520
Chen Shouhe's wife,

7
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:55,920
Su Wanniang.

8
00:01:03,719 --> 00:01:04,560
And that's not all.

9
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:06,640
That miscarriage

10
00:01:06,799 --> 00:01:08,039
was part of her scheme too.

11
00:01:09,039 --> 00:01:10,159
Chunya has confessed.

12
00:01:10,719 --> 00:01:12,519
Su Cao knew something was wrong
with the wick.

13
00:01:13,159 --> 00:01:14,239
She deliberately kept quiet

14
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:15,920
and made sure you stayed the night.

15
00:01:16,799 --> 00:01:18,079
She did it all to

16
00:01:18,319 --> 00:01:19,439
shift the blame onto me.

17
00:01:20,040 --> 00:01:21,079
I suspect

18
00:01:21,519 --> 00:01:23,760
she was never pregnant at all.

19
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:26,879
She entered the palace for revenge,

20
00:01:27,519 --> 00:01:28,799
to hurt me

21
00:01:29,159 --> 00:01:31,480
and drive a wedge between us.

22
00:01:40,239 --> 00:01:41,120
Is what she said

23
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:43,400
true?

24
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,319
Your Majesty.

25
00:01:47,519 --> 00:01:49,280
I've already lost my child.

26
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:51,439
Now, with one accusation,

27
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:53,079
Consort Chen denies he ever existed.

28
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:56,239
Then what were all these days
of pain and bleeding for?

29
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:00,840
This is a serious matter.

30
00:02:01,519 --> 00:02:02,920
Of course I'll investigate it fully.

31
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,640
Since childhood,

32
00:02:04,799 --> 00:02:06,400
I trained under my master
in the mountains.

33
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,879
I only left the mountains
three years ago.

34
00:02:09,439 --> 00:02:10,040
That's why

35
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:13,120
I'm absent from old official records.

36
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,439
As for this woven grass ring,

37
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:17,280
I simply bought it

38
00:02:17,639 --> 00:02:18,680
outside the palace.

39
00:02:20,319 --> 00:02:21,960
But I did hear

40
00:02:22,719 --> 00:02:23,879
of a grass weaver

41
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:26,639
who angered Consort Chen with one remark

42
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,280
and was tortured to death.

43
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,120
I had thought

44
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:32,439
Your Majesty was
the benevolent ruler people praised,

45
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,599
one who'd never tolerate

46
00:02:35,039 --> 00:02:36,680
such disregard for human life
in the harem.

47
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:39,919
But hearing Consort Chen
mention it herself,

48
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:41,319
I now know

49
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:43,360
it was true.

50
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:49,159
What's wrong?

51
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:56,639
Nothing.

52
00:02:56,879 --> 00:02:59,280
The craftsmanship is exquisite.

53
00:02:59,599 --> 00:03:01,120
I was captivated by it.

54
00:03:06,319 --> 00:03:07,039
How dare you!

55
00:03:07,479 --> 00:03:09,120
You're still trying
to talk your way out of this?

56
00:03:09,479 --> 00:03:10,719
Fortunately, I have a witness.

57
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:11,479
You.

58
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:13,000
Say it again. Tell them what you know.

59
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:14,599
She...

60
00:03:15,199 --> 00:03:15,479
She...

61
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:16,800
She really is Su Wanniang.

62
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,080
She came to me

63
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:23,080
and asked me to help her find someone.

64
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:24,639
Then she changed her identity

65
00:03:24,919 --> 00:03:26,560
and returned to the palace for revenge.

66
00:03:27,199 --> 00:03:27,919
A year ago,

67
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:30,039
she even went to Tongzhou

68
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:32,000
to plan with me

69
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:34,039
how to get close to Your Majesty.

70
00:03:36,599 --> 00:03:38,039
You said this was a year ago.

71
00:03:38,439 --> 00:03:39,159
Where was she?

72
00:03:39,439 --> 00:03:39,800
In...

73
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:41,520
In Tongzhou.

74
00:03:41,879 --> 00:03:42,960
A year ago,

75
00:03:43,919 --> 00:03:47,159
she was with me every day
running a free clinic by the cottage.

76
00:03:47,639 --> 00:03:49,000
How could she also

77
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,479
be in Tongzhou?

78
00:03:52,879 --> 00:03:53,319
This...

79
00:03:54,159 --> 00:03:55,439
Tell me the truth!

80
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:56,639
Your Majesty.

81
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,439
Spare me, Your Majesty!

82
00:03:57,639 --> 00:03:58,360
Please spare me, Your Majesty!

83
00:03:59,039 --> 00:04:00,840
I don't actually know anything.

84
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,879
Consort Chen forced me to say all that.

85
00:04:03,319 --> 00:04:05,240
I don't even know Consort Hui.

86
00:04:05,719 --> 00:04:06,800
I won't do it again!

87
00:04:07,039 --> 00:04:08,000
I won't do it again!

88
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:08,639
Nonsense!

89
00:04:08,639 --> 00:04:09,080
Enough!

90
00:04:09,479 --> 00:04:10,719
How long are you going to keep this up?

91
00:04:11,599 --> 00:04:12,120
Your Majesty.

92
00:04:12,439 --> 00:04:14,400
I only wanted to keep
Your Majesty from being deceived.

93
00:04:14,919 --> 00:04:17,680
While still confined, you barged into
Jiyun Pavilion without permission.

94
00:04:17,960 --> 00:04:19,599
You even coerced someone
into giving false testimony

95
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:21,120
to frame Consort Hui.

96
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,160
Guards!

97
00:04:22,759 --> 00:04:24,240
Take Consort Chen back
to Chenghua Palace.

98
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:25,519
Without my permission,

99
00:04:25,879 --> 00:04:27,120
she may not set foot outside.

100
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:28,480
Yes, Your Majesty.

101
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:29,079
Your Majesty!

102
00:04:46,519 --> 00:04:47,079
Su.

103
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,360
I'll ask you one last time.

104
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:55,160
Have you ever deceived me?

105
00:04:56,439 --> 00:04:57,079
Your Majesty.

106
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:59,399
I'm not the one

107
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,879
with something to hide.

108
00:05:11,519 --> 00:05:12,480
Focus on recovering.

109
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,519
As for the rest,

110
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:16,920
I'll handle it.

111
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:30,079
Wanniang.

112
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,800
Consort Chen won't spare my brother.

113
00:05:33,199 --> 00:05:34,639
She won't spare him.

114
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:36,240
What do we do?

115
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:38,560
What do we do?

116
00:05:47,519 --> 00:05:48,160
Your Majesty.

117
00:05:48,519 --> 00:05:50,959
We have the protesters' statements.

118
00:05:51,839 --> 00:05:52,839
They insist

119
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:55,319
their relatives were killed
to silence them,

120
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:58,240
but the old Ministry of Works records

121
00:05:58,720 --> 00:05:59,959
say they died of sudden illness.

122
00:06:00,439 --> 00:06:02,040
If I remember correctly,

123
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,519
the official who handled the case

124
00:06:03,519 --> 00:06:05,680
was Consort Chen's uncle by marriage,

125
00:06:06,079 --> 00:06:07,079
Shen You.

126
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:13,040
Your Majesty, you knew all along?

127
00:06:13,439 --> 00:06:14,759
I investigated it long ago.

128
00:06:15,079 --> 00:06:16,040
Shen You alone

129
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:18,879
couldn't have embezzled that much
from Guizhen Cottage.

130
00:06:19,399 --> 00:06:20,399
Behind him

131
00:06:21,199 --> 00:06:22,399
were Consort Chen

132
00:06:23,319 --> 00:06:24,480
and Zhang Heng.

133
00:06:25,279 --> 00:06:26,600
But Zhang Heng

134
00:06:26,879 --> 00:06:29,160
has just captured seven cities in a row.

135
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,560
His influence is at its peak.

136
00:06:32,439 --> 00:06:33,680
Moving against him now

137
00:06:34,959 --> 00:06:37,040
would push him to rebel.

138
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,720
The attack on Su

139
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:40,319
gave me a reason

140
00:06:40,319 --> 00:06:42,040
to reopen the old case,

141
00:06:43,399 --> 00:06:44,920
but it still isn't enough.

142
00:06:45,279 --> 00:06:46,480
What I'm waiting for

143
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,319
is a chance

144
00:06:49,399 --> 00:06:52,399
to bring Zhang Heng down for good.

145
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:12,987
♪Sunset fades beyond the lonely city♪

146
00:07:13,121 --> 00:07:16,734
♪Dusk snow paints the green hills♪

147
00:07:16,969 --> 00:07:19,568
♪A lone rider storms the old pass♪

148
00:07:19,605 --> 00:07:21,885
♪Drunk, I gaze by lamplight♪

149
00:07:21,932 --> 00:07:25,761
♪Old friends have all drifted away♪

150
00:07:26,163 --> 00:07:29,516
♪My broken sword rusts, as do I♪

151
00:07:30,443 --> 00:07:33,956
♪Jackdaws cry into the night♪

152
00:07:34,456 --> 00:07:37,023
♪Half a banner snaps in the wind♪

153
00:07:37,149 --> 00:07:39,182
♪In dreams, I return to the camps♪

154
00:07:39,249 --> 00:07:43,026
♪Moonlight chills my armor♪

155
00:07:43,376 --> 00:07:47,709
♪Life is a dream through many winters♪

156
00:07:47,932 --> 00:07:51,439
♪I gaze beyond the edge of the world♪

157
00:07:51,620 --> 00:07:54,473
♪Parting sorrow spills across the moon♪

158
00:07:54,540 --> 00:08:00,154
♪The moon and wind mean nothing now♪

159
00:08:00,194 --> 00:08:03,208
♪History turns to ash before ink dries♪

160
00:08:03,249 --> 00:08:09,257
♪Who plays the zither
and sighs at the pavilion?♪

161
00:08:09,924 --> 00:08:16,879
♪The past has faded away♪

162
00:08:16,879 --> 00:08:20,911
♪The past has faded away♪
